  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nApple Inc.\nTicker Symbol: AAPL\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nApple Inc. is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $383,285 million\nOperating Income: $95,821 million  \nNet Income: $96,995 million\nTotal Assets: $352,755 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $383,285\nCost of Revenue         $229,971\nGross Profit           $153,314\nOperating Income        $95,821\nNet Income             $96,995\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $352,755\nTotal Liabilities      $141,102\nStockholders' Equity   $211,653"
}